  "body": "## What\n\nVersion bump to 5.7.1 for the merged rename (#110): the dedicated Claude Code page is now **\"Configure Claude Code\"** and surfaces the per-session `mcc-claude` / `mcc-claude --discover-models` alternative so users can keep normal Claude Code on their Anthropic account.\n\n## Verification\n\n- Change fully verified on the feature branch: 126 admin/docs/onboarding tests, full suite 3706 passed / 26 known baseline, ruff/ty clean, real-browser check.\n- `uv lock` updated (`my-claude-code v5.7.0 -> v5.7.1`).\n\n## Residual risks\n\nNone — label/string-only change.\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)",
